# Azshara - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 8 rank-flagged rares of Azshara (zone key
# 1447) and the 46 fixed world-chest points, verified against the local
# Forever game data (questie-forever NPC/object/item dumps). Every goal is
# optional - a missing spawn never wedges the guide. Single-point rares get
# plain steps; only Master Feardred has 2+ points and loops over ALL three.
# One signature drop ships as an optional collect (Fangferror's sole drop
# 17054 Joonho's Mercy - starts nothing, objective of nothing in the data).
# Everything else gets a kill-note; Varo'then's Ghost also drops core 8256's
# Ichor of Undeath (one of ~120 world droppers), so that step points at the
# core guide. No core quest names any shipped rare. No tame lines: no data
# flag, no drop evidence, no core-guide corroboration (see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Two rank-2 elites (Monnos, Scalebeard) and
# six unflagged named mobs are inventoried exclusions, not steps.
guide butler-routes-completionist/azshara-rares
title Azshara - Rares & Treasures
levels 45-55
zone Azshara
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords azshara, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step West shore - Antilos

  zone map 1447

  goto 16.6,54.1
  kill 6648 optional
  note Antilos (level 50 naga) patrols the west shore single point. Ordinary greens only; nothing unique in the data.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step West ruins - The Evalcharr

  zone map 1447

  goto 17.87,65.6
  kill 8660 optional
  note The Evalcharr (level 48 giant) holds a single west-ruins point. Ordinary greens only.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step West ruins - Varo'then's Ghost

  zone map 1447

  goto 13.23,74.2
  kill 6118 optional
  note Varo'then's Ghost (level 48) holds a single west-ruins point. Its table is ordinary world greens - but it also drops Ichor of Undeath, the objective of core quest 8256 (The Ichor of Undeath): the core guide routes that farm, this step is the opportunistic kill.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step North-center - Gatekeeper Rageroar

  zone map 1447

  goto 38.27,32.08
  kill 6651 optional
  note Gatekeeper Rageroar (level 50 naga) holds a single north-center point near Kim'jael's camp. Ordinary greens only.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Ravencrest - Lady Sesspira

  zone map 1447

  goto 35.39,55.69
  kill 6649 optional
  note Lady Sesspira (level 51 naga, the rank-flagged rare - the same-name regular is a quest-target lookalike and stays out) holds a single Ravencrest point. Ordinary greens only.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Ravencrest - General Fangferror

  zone map 1447

  goto 41.31,53.96
  kill 6650 optional
  collect 17054 "Joonho's Mercy" optional
  note General Fangferror (level 51 naga) holds a single Ravencrest point. Joonho's Mercy is his sole drop anywhere in the data - starts no quest and is no quest's objective, so take it as a trophy.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step East camp - Magister Hawkhelm

  zone map 1447

  goto 58.46,30.89
  kill 6647 optional
  note Magister Hawkhelm (level 52 naga) holds a single east-camp point. Ordinary greens only (his Invisibility Potion recipe is a 560-dropper world drop, not zone content).
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step East shore - Master Feardred

  zone map 1447

  loop
  goto 61.35,24.92
  goto 61.55,24.25
  goto 66.3,16.72
  kill 6652 optional
  note Master Feardred (level 52 naga) works a three-point east-shore patrol - the only multi-point rare in the zone. Ordinary greens only.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

